   "action_zh": "升级至 6.0.7/7.0.2/7.5.0，限制迁移源",
   "repro_worthy": "一般",
   "repro_note": "构造 rsync/btrfs 流，在卷中植入指向主机根的符号链接",
   "impact_scope": "容器/虚拟化宿主机，迁移通道",
   "link": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-115377",
   "description": "Incus before 6.0.7, 6.1.0 before 7.0.2, and 7.1.0 before 7.5.0 contains an arbitrary file write vulnerability that allows malicious migration sources to write host files by planting symlinks in transferred volumes. Attackers can craft rsync or btrfs receive streams with a symlink such as rootfs pointing to the host root, writing files as root for full host compromise."
